{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无；但漏掉了完整稿明确给出的原因：他没想好怎么开口，所以表达喜欢的念头逐渐淡去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把仍在犹豫、担心破坏自在的表达冲动概括成了勇敢，略微高估了他的坦然程度；完整稿还强调了尚未失去什么便已产生的酸楚和对方是否喜欢坦白的自己的期待。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把忘了藏住喜欢概括为失控，容易误成情绪失控；完整稿的重点是心意暴露后突然失去支撑、空落落地不知道如何相处，而不只是羞怯。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无；但感受概括弱化了情欲执念、幻想与遗憾交织，以及越舒服越失去方向的复杂状态，主要写成了笼统的深情和眷恋。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把以后也这么好稍微强化成了一直这样相处下去，带上了更强的永久性意味；完整稿表达的是对未来继续美好的期待，同时明确保留了心里没底的不确定感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把担心对方相处时不自在加重成了担心自己成为对方的负担；完整稿没有明确说对方把他视为负担。另外漏掉了不安逐渐不再占满心思的安静转变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把狂喜、激动到喉咙发紧、想哭又想笑的情绪概括成释怀，误写成了放下或轻松。完整稿表现的是情感彻底涌出、幸福强烈到近乎失去重量，并没有真正释怀。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把不愿把喜欢藏回去说成无法再把喜欢藏起来，把主动选择表达改成了无能为力；完整稿强调的是他已经不愿意再隐藏，而不是失去了隐藏的能力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲从克制靠近、确认对方没有退开，到坦露喜欢、渴望相互需要，最后不再隐藏心意也不再强求永远的保证，主线完全一致，只是局部弱化了情欲、失重感和甜蜜中的悲伤。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "92ad463c-8353-4d1e-9bfc-64bd57c58a62", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T035814210300Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:59:50.215377+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3e07874c9981f18800cf4653bae97002358fba12d802d0e271698de764dd9c1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T035814210300Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f52f3d13180c735c0bedc9ee0784a0b433212a42ba88fe3ce7e85e44cf941e82"}}}
